Decision:    REJECT
  filters_passed:  event_kinds, dex_allowlist, quote_mints
  filters_failed:  min_sol_liquidity (3.2 < 10.0),
                   require_renounced_authorities (cache cold: enrichment-pending)
  risk:            (not evaluated)
